include tokyonight.zathurarc

## options

set font "JetBrainsMono NFM 13"

set incremental-search  true
set selection-clipboard clipboard


## keymap

map              f toggle_fullscreen
map [fullscreen] f toggle_fullscreen

map              <BackSpace> follow
map [fullscreen] <BackSpace> follow
map              <Return>    display_link
map [fullscreen] <Return>    display_link

map              <C-j> scroll half-down
map [fullscreen] <C-j> scroll half-down
map              <C-k> scroll half-up
map [fullscreen] <C-k> scroll half-up

map              <Down> navigate previous
map [fullscreen] <Down> navigate previous
map              <Up>   navigate next
map [fullscreen] <Up>   navigate next
